We gotta get this two Y
squared on the left hand side.

01:36.126 --> 01:39.231
So we can divide both
sides by two Y-squared.

01:39.616 --> 01:44.616
So if we divide both sides by
two Y-squared, two Y-squared,

01:45.416 --> 01:50.416
the left hand side, we could
